# Records demo/demo.gif. Run from the repo root with the demo server up:
#   (cd demo && npm install && npm run server)   # terminal 1
#   vhs demo/demo.tape                           # terminal 2
Output demo/demo.gif

Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1100
Set Height 720
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 25ms

Hide
Type `export PATH="$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH"; clear`
Enter
Show

Type "python demo/run_demo.py --yes --slow"
Enter
Sleep 11s
Sleep 3s
